    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh okay, i'll try to find a pharmacy. actually, i just looked at my kitchen cabinet and i have some old antibiotics from a previous prescription and also some hydrocortisone cream. would it be a good idea to rub some of the cream in the wound to stop the swelling and just take a bunch of the antibiotics now so i don't have to worry about it later?",
